'''Mummy Sumo''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] during the [[Halloween Capsules (Gacha Event)|Halloween Capsules]] event. It is an anti-[[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Floating]]/[[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|Dark]] variant of [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Sumo Cat]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 773
|rarity = SR
|name1 = Mummy Sumo
|name2 = Mama Mummy Sumo
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Mama Mummy Sumo''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Mama Mummy Sumo can be a solid supplemental defense that can be used as a backup for better-suited meat shields such as [[Nono (Rare Cat)|Nono]] or [[Jetpack Cat (Rare Cat)|Jetpack Cat]]. Her long recharge and high cost makes her inefficient in being a main anti-[[:category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] tanker, thus rendering her not as relevant towards Dark enemies. Resistance towards [[:category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemies can prove more useful than her niche towards Dark enemies as she can be used side by side with [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kotatsu Cat]]. Still, it remains best to bring additional meatshields due to her long recharge.

{{Job|Classification = Tanker}}

